{"rpid": "2444738", "root": "0", "parent": "0", "uname": "DarkAngel", "mid": "12796", "level": 5, "vip": 0, "content": "这是个很有意思的短篇；全部的主线通过苹果串联起来；但是其中有什么意境，似乎作者自己也答不上来 XD\n个人感想：苹果恒久远，一颗永流传 XSK\nPS：作者自我简介里都说编码在学习之中，画面难免有所模糊；但是身为搬运工，处理如此的画面，依然不能采用高效的编码模式，反而使用接近一倍的厚黑，你这是欺负我们小带宽和GFW外的破网么？\nPS2：涉及作品列表：Black Cat, Copihan, Darker than Black, Death Note, Erementar Gerad, Ikoku Meiro no Croisee, Kaleido Star, Kemono no Souja Erin, Kurau Phantom Memory, Mahou Shoujo Madoka Magika, Mawaru Penguin Drum, Ookami to Koushinryou, Pandora Hearts, Tears to Tiara", "like": 0, "ctime": 1323189094, "rcount": 0, "ip": "", "images": [], "video_aid": "177123", "video_bvid": "BV1nx411w7nF", "video_title": "苹果 Apple", "video_desc": "akrosscon2011 作者：Seliafel BGM:Джаз Модерн - Танец души", "video_owner": "夏末那首歌", "video_view": 871, "video_reply": 6, "video_n1": 6, "video_n2": 0}
